{"candidateAnswer":"Mom's old house bench, park with forest trail, beach near home, yoga retreat spots, garden with flowers, nature spots by water","evidence":"[D2:13 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: That's my old home. I go there now and then for my mom, who passed away. Sitting in that spot by the window gives me peace.\n[D4:34 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: That sounds great, Jolene. Nature's calming for sure. Guess it helps us forget the daily craziness and find inner peace. No wonder you're a fan! I like to come to this spot by the water near my mom's old house. It's where I reflect on her life and find some peace. Being surrounded by nature helps a lot.\n[D6:10 | 4:12 pm on 22 February, 2023] Deborah: I've been blessed to travel to a few places and Bali last year was one of my favs. It was a gorgeous island that gave me peace, great for yoga.\n[D19:17 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Deborah: I love going to this park near my house - it has a nice forest trail and a beach. It's a peaceful spot where I can do some yoga and reflect. There's also a special bench that holds special meaning to me.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0192d7eb-4884-57c3-aa90-ac9c57f0a678","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b66ded36ea2775ca1e62820463a5222ed9d89ed71ec9ee33e8469caa16e1dfc6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What places give Deborah peace?","referenceAnswer":"sitting in a spot by the window in her Mom's house, sitting by the beach, Bali, forest trail in a nearby park","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b66ded36ea2775ca1e62820463a5222ed9d89ed71ec9ee33e8469caa16e1dfc6"}}]}